@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Topics: list
GET {{baseUrl}}/topics

### Topics: get one (ETag: "1")
GET {{baseUrl}}/topics/3

### Topics: get a missing topic (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/topics/999

### Topics: create (201, Location, ETag: "1")
POST {{baseUrl}}/topics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Managing Users",
  "body": "Add, remove and change the roles of library users.",
  "tags": ["admin", "users"]
}

### Topics: create with validation errors (400, errors keyed title and tags[1])
POST {{baseUrl}}/topics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "tags": ["pdf", "PDF"]
}

### Topics: update with the current version (200, ETag: "2")
PUT {{baseUrl}}/topics/1
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "1"

{
  "title": "Introduction to Author-it",
  "body": "An updated overview of Author-it.",
  "tags": ["overview", "getting-started"]
}

### Topics: stale update, run after the one above (412, currentVersion 2, nothing changed)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/topics/1
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "1"

{
  "title": "Edited from an old copy",
  "body": "This edit was based on version 1.",
  "tags": ["overview"]
}

### Topics: update a missing topic without If-Match (404 wins over 428)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/topics/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Nowhere",
  "body": "",
  "tags": []
}

### Topics: update without If-Match (428)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/topics/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "No precondition",
  "body": "",
  "tags": []
}

